#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:86
#: 92323df402dd43fe992d12f379c5e8cf
msgid ""
"If you connect the gimbal as shown in the above diagram, it is NOT possible "
"to establish a connection to the GUI on a PC via USB and have it connected "
"simultaneously to the autopilot. It happens because the UART1 (\"serial\" in"
" the picture above) is \"paralleled to the onboard USB-UART converter "
"(excepting the \"Tiny\" boards that has a dedicated USB). If you "
"accidentally connect both the GUI via USB and an autopilot via UART1, you "
"might end up with corrupt data on the flash of the gimbal. It can result in "
"unexpected motor movement! The reason details, please check the `link "
"<https://www.basecamelectronics.com/files/v3/SimpleBGC_32bit_manual_2_6x_eng.pdf>`__."
msgstr ""
"按上图连接云台后，无法同时通过 USB 连接 PC 上的 GUI 并连接飞控。这是因为 UART1（图中的「serial」）与板载 USB-UART "
"转换器并联（专用 USB 的「Tiny」板除外）。若同时通过 USB 连接 GUI 和通过 UART1 "
"连接飞控，可能导致云台闪存数据损坏，进而引起电机意外动作！详细原因请查阅 `此链接 "
"<https://www.basecamelectronics.com/files/v3/SimpleBGC_32bit_manual_2_6x_eng.pdf>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:92
#: abb1a29cbedd4a0fa01f0181e80d92aa
msgid "Testing the gimbal moves correctly"
msgstr "测试云台运动是否正常"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:94
#: 2cc45f5dce8843db83ac346f0d74d90a
msgid "**Testing the pilot's control of pitch**"
msgstr "**测试飞手对俯仰的控制**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:96
#: 604638904e444779b79d8fb11684b1e0
msgid ""
"Once powered the gimbal should point to its Pitch Angle Min (i.e. straight "
"down) when your transmitter's channel 6 tuning knob is at its minimum PWM "
"value (perhaps around 1000) and the camera should point to its maximum pitch"
" angle (i.e. straight forward) when the tuning knob is at its maximum "
"(perhaps around 2000). The Mission Planner Radio calibration page can be "
"used to check the Ch6's current input PWM value."
msgstr ""
"通电后，当遥控器第 6 通道调节旋钮处于最小 PWM 值（约 1000）时，云台应指向其最小俯仰角（即正下方）；旋钮处于最大值（约 "
"2000）时，相机应指向最大俯仰角（即正前方）。Mission Planner 无线电校准页面可用于查看第 6 通道当前输入 PWM 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:99
#: 89f1fb187d79452192fa194c57e66b97
msgid "**Testing ROI**"
msgstr "**测试 ROI**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:101
#: 3cfcd7823e2e4b4fbf4b97fed269ab90
msgid ""
"**You must have a GPS lock to test ROI.** The ROI feature points the vehicle"
" and/or camera to point at a target. The instructions above describe setting"
" up the APM/Pixhawk so that it only controls the pitch of the Tarot gimbal "
"so when a :ref:`Do-Set-ROI <copter:mission-command-list_do-set-roi>` command"
" is received Copter will attempt to turn the vehicle's nose to point in the "
"direction of the target and pitch camera depending upon the vehicle's "
"distance and altitude. You can test the gimbal pitch moves correctly by "
"connecting with the mission planner, then on the Flight Data screen's map, "
"right-mouse-button-click on a point about 50m ahead of the vehicle (the "
"orange and red lines show the vehicle's current heading), select **Point "
"Camera Here** and input an altitude of -50 (meters). This should cause the "
"gimbal to point down at about 45 degrees."
msgstr ""
"**测试 ROI 必须先获取 GPS 定位。** ROI 功能使飞行器和/或相机指向目标点。上述说明描述了如何配置 APM/Pixhawk 以仅控制 "
"Tarot 云台的俯仰，因此当接收到 :ref:`Do-Set-ROI <copter:mission-command-list_do-set-"
"roi>` 命令时，Copter 将尝试将机头转向目标方向，并根据飞行器距目标的距离和高度调整相机俯仰角。可通过以下方式测试云台俯仰是否正常：连接 "
"Mission Planner 后，在飞行数据页面地图上，在飞行器前方约 50 米处右键单击（橙色和红色线条显示飞行器当前航向），选择 **Point "
"Camera Here** 并输入高度 -50（米）。这应使云台向下倾斜约 45 度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:110
#: 57cd4b03f5354d99a5d4a7fd9e3f7359
msgid ""
"Pilot control of the gimbal can be restored by setting up an :ref:`auxiliary"
" function switch <common-auxiliary-functions>` to either “Retract Mount1” "
"(i.e. RCx_OPTION = 27) or \"Retract Mount2\" (i.e. RCx_OPTION = 113), and "
"then move the switch to the lower position"
msgstr ""
"可通过设置 :ref:`辅助功能开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 恢复飞手对云台的控制，将其设为「Retract "
"Mount1」（即 RCx_OPTION = 27）或「Retract Mount2」（即 RCx_OPTION = 113），然后将开关拨至低位"
